{"script":"yd_012_08-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]其实相比起狼来说，我们恐狼和恐兽更加相近。[r]我们直立的双足使我们有着极强爆发力，在一瞬间实现加速、跳跃之类的行动。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]速度和灵活性对于打猎来说非常重要，而我们恐狼的体质恰恰能满足这两点需求。[r]因此猎人这一职业，就成了我们族群大部分人的选择之一。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]不过我们有一个缺点，那就是力量偏弱。[r]就算是角猪这样的魔物，我们也需要很强壮的人才能正面制服，更别说是岩蟾蜍那种力量型魔物了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]正因为这个弱点，我们族人大部分都喜欢使用弓箭远距离击倒猎物。[r]而且为了保证狩猎的安全与效率，大多数恐狼都会选择群体行动。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]你问我为什么总是一个人狩猎？[r]哈哈，我主要是一个人行动惯了，不太适应和其他人去一起打猎。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]如果你们想要和我一起打猎的话也行，不过我们的要狩猎的目标最好要定高一点了。[r]毕竟……杀鸡焉用牛刀呢。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-恐狼魔人"}